Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:05:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] FreeChat: room privacy settings in room details

Auto-delete (admins; both members in a DM), my burn-after-read override,
screenshot protection and the join password. Strings live in FreeChatStrings
so upstream translations never conflict. Untested: needs a Mac to build.
